# Keep deliberate in-file encodings intact.
#
# The `.ps1` scripts carry a UTF-8 BOM on purpose: Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads a
# BOM-less UTF-8 script as ANSI, and these files contain Chinese comments, so the
# script fails to parse *silently* — no log, no error. Git's line-ending
# normalization must not touch them, and the sample documents are binary for the
# same reason.
*.ps1 -text
*.cmd -text
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
